  "description": "Rishar Friedrich is only the second male lead in a romance story, condemned to watch the woman he loves, Daphne, choose Crown Prince Kailus and die. After 48 failed lives, he makes one desperate attempt to end the cycle by killing Kailus, only for the world to shatter and reset again. If killing him won’t save Daphne, Rishar has only one absurd plan left: He’ll steal the crown prince for himself! But can Rishar steal the man destined for Daphne and rewrite her tragic fate?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
